# M28 Hole Fill (UE UHoleFillTool, MeshOps palette "Mesh"): Box 100 cm with its top face deleted in PolyModel -> Hole Fill Minimal, Select All Holes (preview) -> Accept -> Undo. Lit, seen from above and to the side.
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.3,-0.9,0.3
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "Select Elements tool"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh operation: Delete"
Тогда-вид 0_hole the Box has no top: its inside walls and floor are seen through the open top
Когда run Modeling "Mesh tool: Hole Fill"
Когда run Modeling "Hole Fill type: Minimal"
Когда run Modeling "Hole Fill: Select All Holes"
Тогда 0b_panel the Mesh palette shows Hole Fill, Fill Type Minimal, "Holes: 1 selected of 1", the status reports the fill
Тогда-вид 1_fill_preview the hole is closed by the preview face; the hole's rim is drawn in the selection colour
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 1_fill after Accept the Box's top is closed (no rim drawn: the tool ended)
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 2_undo after Undo the hole is open again: the inside is visible
